'' A 'for' OVER A UDT WHOSE 'operator next' RETURNS BYREF tests the value behind the reference, not
'' its address: the loop runs 5 times as fbc's does, where tiko's never ended (fbc's
'' functions/return-byref.bas operators). Expected output is fbc-modern's.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: -target windows-x86_64 tests/codegen/src/for-next-byref.bas -o tests/codegen/fornextbyref.exe
'' ENV: TIKO_LIBPATH=build/obj/rtlib/windows-x86_64
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 0
'' RUN: tests/codegen/fornextbyref.exe
'' EXPECT-RUN-EXIT: 0
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT:  5
